description: |-
  Adds or removes tags on one or more timeline records in a Cortex case.
  Use tags_to_add to append new tags (existing tags are preserved).
  Use tags_to_remove to remove specific tags (other existing tags are preserved).
  Use remove_all to clear all tags from the records without needing to know the current tags.
  At least one of tags_to_add, tags_to_remove, or remove_all must be provided.
